  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 103.01 Composition of the Board. The board shall consist of 5 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 328-E:7 and are appointed by the governor.\n\nSource. #6379, eff 11-26-96; ss by #8299, eff 3-9-05",
